# Add newest entries at the top.

* Sun Nov 22 2026 Ævar Eggertsson <aevar@eggerts.xyz> 0.4.4
- One-shot results (copied, saved, synced, settings changes) now show as
  toasts with success/warning/error styling instead of the plain top banner
- Sign-in, unlock and two-factor errors show as an inline error banner under
  the page header
- Comment cleanup under the hood

* Sat Nov 21 2026 Ævar Eggertsson <aevar@eggerts.xyz> 0.4.3
- Show the app version in Settings → About, baked in from the release at
  build time (local builds show "dev")
- Norwegian (Bokmål) translations
- Auto-sync the vault when the local copy is over a day old: on app open,
  when foregrounded, and after unlock; background syncs fail silently so
  offline unlock keeps working
- The lock screen now offers only Sync now and Sign out
- Busy spinner in the top bar while the app works (login, unlock, sync, writes)
- Fix vault section headers (Favourites / Other items) being cut off at the
  right screen edge

* Sat Nov 21 2026 Ævar Eggertsson <aevar@eggerts.xyz> 0.4.2
- Release RPMs carry a keyless Sigstore build-provenance attestation; verify
  an asset was built by this repo's release workflow with
  `gh attestation verify <file>.rpm --repo aevare/harbour-leyni`

* Sat Nov 21 2026 Ævar Eggertsson <aevar@eggerts.xyz> 0.4.1
- Fix creating and editing items on Vaultwarden 1.37 and newer (server
  rejected them with HTTP 422). After updating, sync the vault once before
  creating or editing items
- Tests: register test accounts via the two-step flow Vaultwarden 1.37 uses

* Fri Nov 20 2026 Ævar Eggertsson <aevar@eggerts.xyz> 0.4.0
- Store the PIN-wrapped key, refresh token and wrong-PIN counter in Sailfish
  Secrets instead of plain files; existing values are migrated on first start
- Add the Secrets Sailjail permission
- Unlock page opens the keyboard on the PIN field right away
- Search keeps the keyboard open while the list filters; debounce removed
- Notice banner sits below display cutouts and has readable contrast

* Sat Jul 25 2026 Ævar Eggertsson <aevar@eggerts.xyz> 0.1.3
- Fix settings and vault data not persisting under the Sailjail sandbox
- Docs: sync README and development plan with current features

* Mon Jul 20 2026 Ævar Eggertsson <aevar@eggerts.xyz> 0.1.2
- Rename app from BitVault to Leyni (harbour-leyni)
- CI: fix tag-driven release workflow (reusable test workflows)

